# Media is stored as normal git files: GitHub refuses Git LFS uploads to public forks, and this
# repo is a fork. Keep every file under GitHub's 100 MB limit (render.mjs uses CRF 20, which puts a
# 7-minute video near 50 MB). If the repo is ever detached from the fork network, LFS can be
# switched on by uncommenting these two lines (and running `git lfs migrate` for old files).
# videos/**/output/** filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# videos/**/audio/** filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.png binary
